WEBVTT

00:00:00.487 --> 00:00:01.226
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Chris

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:07.264
<v><b>Chris:</b></v> I like cooking alone. I don’t like having other people in the kitchen.

00:00:08.073 --> 00:00:15.644
But I like eating with friends, especially when I’m out. I don’t like being alone in a restaurant.

00:00:17.704 --> 00:00:18.576
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Sarah

00:00:19.471 --> 00:00:24.365
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> I don’t like travelling alone – I prefer going on holiday with friends.

00:00:24.547 --> 00:00:26.793
But they need to be the right friends!

00:00:28.922 --> 00:00:29.702
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Mike

00:00:30.672 --> 00:00:32.718
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> I like shopping with friends.

00:00:33.178 --> 00:00:36.988
When I go alone I usually buy things that look horrible on me.

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:38.985
I need a second opinion!

00:00:41.004 --> 00:00:41.783
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Greta

00:00:42.783 --> 00:00:48.997
<v><b>Greta:</b></v> I love dancing alone at home to really old music from the 70s, like Abba.

00:00:49.429 --> 00:00:54.927
But I never dance with other people at parties because I know I’m a terrible dancer.

00:00:56.943 --> 00:00:57.936
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Veronica

00:00:58.995 --> 00:01:05.321
<v><b>Veronica:</b></v> I like watching films with friends. When the film finishes, we can talk about it,

00:01:05.605 --> 00:01:10.772
and I like having someone with me so we can be happy or frightened together!

00:01:12.859 --> 00:01:13.570
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Becca

00:01:14.564 --> 00:01:21.046
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> I like running alone. It helps me to concentrate, and it’s very peaceful!

00:01:21.725 --> 00:01:27.637
But I prefer going for walks with other people because I like walking and talking.

00:01:29.755 --> 00:01:30.525
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Andy

00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:33.318
<v><b>Andy:</b></v> I like driving alone.

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:39.569
I love listening to my favourite music in the car and singing very loudly –

00:01:40.158 --> 00:01:42.928
but with the windows closed of course!